<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova discount rate unchanged at 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Moldova discount rate unchanged at 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's National Bank kept its official discount rate steady at 21 percent annual on Tuesday, a National Bank official said.</p>
<p>The rate, unchanged since April 21, was set at a credit funds auction where seven banks acquired a total of 18.25 million lei ($3.97 million) of National Bank reserves.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
